    kind: work_item  # 1177
    title: "Sketch Configuration reads manifests with regular expressions over the text: a TOML inline table prints half-read (license: { text =, version: {attr =) on 3 of 6 repositories with a pyproject.toml line"  # 1177
    status: todo_hard  # 1177
    priority: 4  # 1177
