  message: "Fixed in PR #2183. pyproject.toml and Cargo.toml are parsed as TOML and pom.xml with ElementTree; package.json licence objects, Gradle and Gemfile literals are read whole or left out. BEHAVIOUR on real repositories with the merged code: kserve prints 'python/aiffairness/pyproject.toml: name: aifserver; version: 0.16.0; license: Apache-2.0' (14 lines read 'license: { text =' before); sqlalchemy 'version: dynamic' (was 'version: {attr ='); mitmproxy 'license: file LICENSE'; killbill's modules print their own artifactId ('account/pom.xml: ... artifactId: killbill-account', every module printed 'artifactId: killbill' before). Half-read values in the 20-repository run: 0 after, 3 repositories before. Tests: test_sketch_manifest_values.py (all eight manifest kinds; every printed line is checked for an unbalanced brace, bracket or quote). Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/outside_reader_review2_11142026 (results.txt before, results_after.txt after; 20 repositories that are not hypergumbo, re-surveyed on the PR branch before its last two sketch commits, which were checked by direct calls). "  # 100e
